// Onboards SV_SUPPLY_CHAIN - a genuine M:M relationship via the PARTSUPP
// bridge table (6 tables, 5 relationships). README already documents
// Navigator preview errors for this view ("Preview Errors for Complex
// Semantic Views"); this is the first end-to-end DirectQuery smoke test of
// it, using a compatible dimension/metric combination (dimensions and
// metrics both from the PART/PARTSUPP side of the bridge).
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS(
    SV_SUPPLY_CHAIN[BRAND],
    "Total Supply Cost", SUM(SV_SUPPLY_CHAIN[TOTAL_SUPPLY_COST]),
    "Total Avail Qty", SUM(SV_SUPPLY_CHAIN[TOTAL_AVAIL_QTY])
)
ORDER BY SV_SUPPLY_CHAIN[BRAND]
